# Settings-file keys this project type never reads (issue #332), one per
# line: the key, a blank, then the reason shown to the user. A key listed
# here is refused by `project_setting.sh set`, and a hand-written one fails
# `project_setting.sh check` and stops the adapter, so a setting is never
# stored and silently ignored. Read by _project_type_unused_setting in
# .agent/scripts/_project_registry.sh; validate_adapter.sh checks every
# entry is a known key, listed once, with a reason.
bootstrap_url a single_project checkout is cloned by hand; only a ros2_colcon project fetches its manifest from a bootstrap.yaml
source a single_project checkout is cloned by hand and nothing resolves a source for it (a source for every type is issue #473); only a ros2_colcon project reads it, as its manifest: register it as type ros2_colcon (register_project.sh <path> ros2_colcon ...)
source_ref a single_project checkout is cloned by hand and nothing resolves a source for it (a source for every type is issue #473); only a ros2_colcon project reads it, with source: register it as type ros2_colcon (register_project.sh <path> ros2_colcon ...)
source_path a single_project checkout is cloned by hand and nothing resolves a source for it (a source for every type is issue #473); only a ros2_colcon project reads it, with source: register it as type ros2_colcon (register_project.sh <path> ros2_colcon ...)
